{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15133","headline":"登天坛夜见海 · 李益","name":"登天坛夜见海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝游碧峯三十六，夜上天坛月边宿。\n仙人携我搴玉英，坛上夜半东方明。\n僊钟撞撞近海日，海中离离三山出。\n霞梯赤城遥可分，霓旌绦节倚彤云。\n八鸾五凤纷在御，王母欲上朝元君。\n羣仙指此爲我说，几见尘飞沧海竭。\n竦身别我期丹宫，空山处处遗清风。\n九州下视杳未旦，一半浮生皆梦中。\n始知武皇求不死，去逐瀛洲羡门子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}